("char:think|clock", "But there's another theory, and many people find it even more convincing. It's simpler. And it's sadder."),
("chrono:wrong", "Remember the chronometer, the special clock? Researchers studying the ship's records believe it may have been wrong. Enough to make the captain miscalculate where they were by a long way."),
("map:island", "That would mean Briggs thought he was further west than he really was. When Santa Maria Island appeared, it might have been the first land he'd seen in days, and later than he expected."),
