("char:scared|water", "From where he stands, it looks like his ship could be sinking. With his wife and child on board, and land in sight."),
("boat:island", "So he makes a decision. Take the sextant, take the chronometer, take the papers, and row for the island. It was close. It looked safe."),
("ship:float", "But the ship was not sinking. The water was manageable. The Mary Celeste was strong enough to sail on for nine more days, all by herself."),
