# LESSON
("char:sad|heart", "Here's what stays with me. Captain Briggs wasn't reckless. He was careful. He did what a loving, responsible person would do when he thought his family was in danger."),
("char:point|ship", "And that's exactly what makes this story hurt. The ship he left behind was the safest place in the whole ocean."),
("char:think|heart", "Fear is very convincing. It shows you the worst possible version of what's happening, and it asks you to act right now, before you've checked anything."),
("char:curious|rod", "Sometimes the bravest thing isn't to jump. It's to stop, measure the water, and ask: is this actually sinking? Or does it just feel like it is?"),
("char:happy|book", "And the second lesson? Stories grow. A short story by a young doctor turned into a legend that millions believe. Always ask where a detail comes from."),
